{"id":"fbe29208-d25d-472f-9497-0fba8823f9fe","object":"chat.completion","created":1793242527,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\": \"The previous read_symbol failed because the class is `EnvVar` (generic syntax) not `_Descriptor`. I now have the EnvVar descriptor class, rearm, and rearm_all via evidence. I still need the logger.py formatter/default-init region (ev-f1b475) and environ.py lines 94-215 (ev-09ad). Let me write a combined note on environ mechanism now using the evidence I have, then read the remaining logger regions.\", \"code\": \"n = write_note(title='environ config mechanism', content='environ.py defines `class EnvVar[T]` (generic, __slots__ name/init/lock), registered in _descriptors via __set_name__, used as non-data descriptor on class `envs`. __get__ caches: checks owner.__dict__.get(self.name, self); if cached value exists returns it; otherwise calls self.init(os.getenv(self.name)); on exception re-raises same type with prefix f\\\"{self.name}: {e}\\\" (TypeError falls back to bare raise); then setattr(owner, self.name, value) caches, so later env changes do not affect value until rearm. Factory staticmethods: int(default=0)->_int, float->_float, bool->_bool, str->_str, str_or_none()->lambda v: v (returns None when unset), int_or_none(), choice(default, choices). New config DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS can follow str_or_none/int_or_none style but must validate >=32 and add a factory (e.g. EnvVar factory method) parsing int and raising ValueError mentioning the name; __get__ prepends the name anyway. `rearm(name)` does setattr(envs, name, _descriptors[name]) so next access re-resolves; `rearm_all()` loops all descriptors doing same. This preserves caching semantics: env edits alone do not change attribute, only rearm+reaccess does.', evidence_ids=['ev-eae82c05a3a3c473d07d','ev-383fc4d6af8a1cd465f1','ev-8d9367024e9cf0226e42'], section='source-note')\\nprint(n)\"}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8544,"completion_tokens":483,"total_tokens":9027,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5376},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5376,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3168},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}